---
title: Multi-channel delivery adapter layer
---
flowchart LR
  SEND["Send<br/>journey · campaign · transactional"]
  SUP{"Suppression &<br/>consent check"}
  FC{"Frequency cap /<br/>quiet hours"}
  FAC["Channel adapter factory"]
  subgraph email["Email"]
    SMTP[SMTP]
    SES[AWS SES]
    PM[Postmark]
    RES[Resend]
    MG[Mailgun]
  end
  SMS["SMS<br/>Twilio · Vonage"]
  WA["WhatsApp<br/>Cloud API"]
  PUSH["Web push<br/>VAPID"]
  TRACK["Open/click tracking<br/>(apps/tracking)"]
  DROP["Drop + log"]
  SEND --> SUP
  SUP -->|allowed| FC
  SUP -->|suppressed| DROP
  FC -->|allowed| FAC
  FAC --> email
  FAC --> SMS
  FAC --> WA
  FAC --> PUSH
  email --> TRACK
